{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"Removed legacy deposit pricing, fields, and exports. The optional `notifyHook` receives each new booking’s total and each cancellation’s refund, in cents.\n\nHooks run before booking changes are saved. If a hook throws, the original error propagates and no booking changes are saved, even if the failure occurs on a later room in a group. Earlier callbacks may already have run, and their assigned IDs are not reused. Reentrant booking writes are rejected while a hook runs.\n\n`node benchmarks/sources/ev2_ts_bookings/run_checks.mjs` exited 0 with all 28 tests passing."}}
